{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"警方打擊白牌車　過去一周拘捕四名本地及內地男子\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CAR-REAX-261101-20.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】警方表示過去一周先後拘捕兩名本地男子及兩名持雙程證內地男子，涉嫌非法出租及取酬載客，會繼續根據行動優次，持續調配適當資源打擊非法出租或載客取酬活動。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:46.856544+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T13:06:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T09:19:46.246514+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:02.082621+00:00","content_hash":"93cdacdc5a6dc3363d09e29ce21b761d7b76d7776e1e30639c1fddbbadde9694","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:46.856544+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}